  "notes": "Every text is one complete JSON document. Hosts must agree with JSON.parse on each case; value is the parsed result, and object key order is part of it. Host-only limits (nesting depth, numbers outside the double range) are not listed because JSON.parse has no such limits.",
  "cases": [
    {"name":"literals","text":"[true,false,null]","expected":{"kind":"accepted","value":[true,false,null]}},
